@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
@sellerId = e065d914-5f21-4665-a6d9-7d0309247210
@productId = REPLACE-WITH-A-PRODUCT-ID

### Create product -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerId": "{{sellerId}}",
  "name": "Sample Game Key",
  "description": "Created from products.http"
}

### List products -> 200
GET {{base}}?sellerId={{sellerId}}&page=0&size=10

### Get product -> 200
GET {{base}}/{{productId}}?sellerId={{sellerId}}

### Get with a different seller -> 404
GET {{base}}/{{productId}}?sellerId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Partial update -> 200 (409 if archived)
PATCH {{base}}/{{productId}}?sellerId={{sellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Renamed Key" }

### Empty patch -> 400
PATCH {{base}}/{{productId}}?sellerId={{sellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Archive -> 200, repeating it -> 409
POST {{base}}/{{productId}}/archive?sellerId={{sellerId}}

### Oversized page -> 400
GET {{base}}?sellerId={{sellerId}}&size=101

### Blank name -> 400
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sellerId": "{{sellerId}}", "name": "   " }
